    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/30534b0a1150fa73c8e8f7652ece46ae.poster.avif?t=1752107955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/30534b0a1150fa73c8e8f7652ece46ae.webm?t=1752107955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Cabbage Effect</i> is a cartoon-pop-surrealistic twin-stick shooter with brawl elements and procedurally generated stages that takes place in an apocalyptic narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game shows that planet Earth was invaded by complex and strange creatures and, during the attack, the planet was protected by a small team with their vehicles and gadgets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/4c851354f70997244622ca7a3bbf655b.poster.avif?t=1752107955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/4c851354f70997244622ca7a3bbf655b.webm?t=1752107955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/4c851354f70997244622ca7a3bbf655b.mp4?t=1752107955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlockable character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A variety of absurd weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The player can pick up objects and throw them at opponents or to interact with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experimental narrative that explores aesthetic elements of non-verbal storytelling and communication noise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/92f3d2d1940f1ee8070c7e475ac9d01f.poster.avif?t=1752107955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/92f3d2d1940f1ee8070c7e475ac9d01f.webm?t=1752107955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/92f3d2d1940f1ee8070c7e475ac9d01f.mp4?t=1752107955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/3e8ade38148cd7b8800c882d6545a0bd.poster.avif?t=1752107955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342150/extras/3e8ade38148cd7b8800c882d6545a0bd.webm?t=1752107955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
