    "reviews": "\u201cBrazilian studio Ninja garage announced The cabbage effect. Behind the agricultural name is a crazy low-poly action film.\u201d<br>SAMAGAME<br><br>\u201cThe Cabbage Effect\u2018s trailer seems to show us the video game equivalent of an LSD and peyote soaked fever dream where we\u2019re even afraid to mention anything we\u2019ve seen for fear it\u2019ll act like some kind of psychologist summoning ritual and doom us to a life of trying to come to terms with what we saw.\u201d<br>PixelJudge<br>",
